  "reference": "Isaiah 14",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will have mercy on Jacob, and will yet choose Israel, and set them in their own land: and the strangers shall be joined with them, and they shall cleave to the house of Jacob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the people shall take them, and bring them to their place: and the house of Israel shall possess them in the land of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for servants and handmaids: and they shall take them captives, whose captives they were; and they shall rule over their oppressors.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass in the day that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall give thee rest from thy sorrow, and from thy fear, and from the hard bondage wherein thou wast made to serve,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ That thou shalt take up this proverb against the king of Babylon, and say, How hath the oppressor ceased! the golden city ceased!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath broken the staff of the wicked,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the sceptre of the rulers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He who smote the people in wrath with a continual stroke, he that ruled the nations in anger, is persecuted,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "none hindereth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The whole earth is at rest,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is quiet: they break forth into singing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, the fir trees rejoice at thee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the cedars of Lebanon,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", Since thou art laid down, no feller is come up against us.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hell from beneath is moved for thee to meet",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thee",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at thy coming: it stirreth up the dead for thee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all the chief ones of the earth; it hath raised up from their thrones all the kings of the nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All they shall speak and say unto thee, Art thou also become weak as we? art thou become like unto us?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy pomp is brought down to the grave,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the noise of thy viols: the worm is spread under thee, and the worms cover thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How art thou fallen from heaven, O Lucifer, son of the morning!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "how",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "art thou cut down to the ground, which didst weaken the nations!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou hast said in thine heart, I will ascend into heaven, I will exalt my throne above the stars of God: I will sit also upon the mount of the congregation, in the sides of the north:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will ascend above the heights of the clouds; I will be like the most High.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet thou shalt be brought down to hell, to the sides of the pit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They that see thee shall narrowly look upon thee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "consider thee,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying, Is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this the man that made the earth to tremble, that did shake kingdoms;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "That",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "made the world as a wilderness, and destroyed the cities thereof;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "opened not the house of his prisoners?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "All the kings of the nations,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all of them, lie in glory, every one in his own house.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But thou art cast out of thy grave like an abominable branch,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and as",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the raiment of those that are slain, thrust through with a sword, that go down to the stones of the pit; as a carcase trodden under feet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt not be joined with them in burial, because thou hast destroyed thy land,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "slain thy people: the seed of evildoers shall never be renowned.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Prepare slaughter for his children for the iniquity of their fathers; that they do not rise, nor possess the land, nor fill the face of the world with cities.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I will rise up against them, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts, and cut off from Babylon the name, and remnant, and son, and nephew, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ISA.14.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will also make it a possession for the bittern, and pools of water: and I will sweep it with the besom of destruction, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
